            <h3 data-number="5.4.3" id="codecresource"><span
            class="header-section-number">5.4.3</span> <span
            class="citation"
            data-cites="codecResource">@codecResource</span></h3>
            <p><strong>Attribute name:</strong> <a
            href="http://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#codecResource">lido:codecResource</a></p>
            <p><strong>Note:</strong> Attribute for &lt;<a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#linkResource">lido:linkResource</a>&gt;
            and &lt;<a
            href="https://lido-schema.org/schema/latest/lido.html#resourceSet">lido:resourceSet</a>&gt;
            to indicate that a particular codec is required for
            rendering the resource. Values and URIs for codec names can
            be found in the <a
            href="http://metadataregistry.org/uri/Codecs">Open Metadata
            Registry</a>.</p>
            <p><strong>Example:</strong> The following XML code snippet
            indicates that the linked resource is a provided audio to be
            rendered as digital audio encoded according to a
            specification officially named MPEG Audio Version 1 Layer 3
            (colloquially referred to as MP3). The resource is an ‘<a
            href="https://www.deutsche-digitale-bibliothek.de/item/CW4ACDL2YTHT7YP2BKIAO56KM66PKPBQ">audio
            excerpt</a>’ from the opera <em><a
            href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mona_Lisa_(opera)">Mona
            Lisa</a></em>, provided by the German Digital Library.</p>
            <div class="sourceCode" id="cb48"><pre
            class="sourceCode xml"><code class="sourceCode xml"><span id="cb48-1"><a href="#cb48-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>&lt;<span class="kw">lido:resourceRepresentation</span></span>
<span id="cb48-2"><a href="#cb48-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="ot">    lido:type=</span><span class="st">&quot;http://terminology.lido-schema.org/lido00465&quot;</span>&gt;</span>
<span id="cb48-3"><a href="#cb48-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a>    &lt;<span class="kw">lido:linkResource</sp